Subject: [PATCH 015/168] ci: GitHub Actions workflow (lint + typecheck + test
 + rust-check + installer-build + desktop-build + install-sh-manifest)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- 7 jobs: lint / typecheck / test / rust-check / installer-build / desktop-build / install-sh-manifest
- lint + typecheck 跑 ubuntu (Node 22 + pnpm 11)
- rust-check 跑 macos (Rust 1.77)
- installer-build / desktop-build 跑 macos, 出 .dmg + .app artifact
- install-sh-manifest 烟测 (出 manifest JSON, 验 11 stages)

